flowchart LR
  subgraph V1["CleanCloud Analytics · Tier 2 · the control"]
    direction TB
    A1["Coherent questionnaire answers"]
    A2["Clean SOC 2 style report"]
    A3["<b>Expected</b> — score 80 or above,<br/>band approve, no findings above low"]
    A4["<b>Proves</b> — the happy path and<br/>that the rubric is calibrated"]
